																">
									<p class="post-meta">by <span class="author vcard"><a href="https://www.hindscc.edu/author/cathy-hayden" title="Posts by Cathy Hayden" rel="author">Cathy Hayden</a></span> | <span class="published">May 19, 2026</span> | <a href="https://www.hindscc.edu/category/news" rel="category tag">News</a> | 0 Comments</p><div>ACKSON – Hinds Community College inducted students into the Alpha Delta Nu nursing honor society on May 8. Alpha Delta Nu is the only national honor society specifically for Associate Degree Nursing (ADN) students. Established by the Organization for Associate Degree...</div>								</div>
														<div class="et_pb_button_wrapper"><a class="et_pb_button et_pb_more_button" href="https://www.hindscc.edu/hinds-cc-inducts-alpha-delta-nu-nursing-honor-society">Read More</a></div>						</div>
